|title=IJMS — Editors |access-date=2012-03-07}}</ref>  More than 1,000 people are on the journal's [[editorial board]].<ref name=\"Oviedo-García\">{{cite journal |last=Ángeles Oviedo-García |first=Maria |date=11 August 2021 |title=Journal citation reports and the definition of a predatory journal: The case of the Multidisciplinary Digital Publishing Institute (MDPI) |url=https://academic.oup.com/rev/article/30/3/405/6348133 |journal=Research Evaluation |volume=30 |issue=3 |pages=405–419a |doi=10.1093/reseval/rvab030 |doi-access=free}}</ref>\n\n== Special issues ==\nIn 2019, this journal published 500 [[Supplement (publishing)|special issues]].<ref name=\"Oviedo-García\" />  According to Jack Grove in ''[[Inside Higher Ed]]'', it planned 3,514 \"special issues with a closing date in 2023\" – nearly 10 per day.<ref name=\"Grove\" />\n\n==Abstracting and indexing==\nThe journal is abstracted and indexed in:\n{{columns-list|colwidth=30em|\n*[[AGORA]]\n*[[CAB Abstracts]]\n*[[Chemical Abstracts]]\n*[[Current Contents]]/Physical, Chemical & Earth Sciences\n*[[EBSCO Information Services|EBSCO databases]]\n*[[EMBASE]]\n*[[Food Science and Technology Abstracts]]\n*[[Global Health (database)|Global Health]]\n*[[HINARI]]\n*[[Index Medicus]]/[[MEDLINE]]/[[PubMed]]<ref>{{Cite web | url=https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/nlmcatalog/101092791 |title = International journal of molecular sciences. - NLM Catalog - NCBI}}</ref>\n*[[Polymer Library]]\n*[[Science Citation Index Expanded]]\n*[[Scopus]]\n}}\nAccording to the ''[[Journal Citation Reports]]'', the journal has a 2023 [[impact factor]] of 4.9.<ref name=WoS>{{cite book |year=2024 |chapter=International Journal of Molecular Sciences |title=2023 Journal Citation Reports |publisher=[[Clarivate]] |edition=Science |series=[[Web of Science]] |title-link=Journal Citation Reports}}</ref>\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n==External links==\n*{{Official website|http://www.mdpi.com/journal/ijms/}}\n\n[[Category:Biochemistry journals]]\n[[Category:Open-access journals]]\n[[Category:MDPI academic journals]]\n[[Category:English-language journals]]\n[[Category:Monthly journals]]\n[[Category:Academic journals established in 2000]]\n\n\n{{Biochemistry-journal-stub}}"}}}],"contentmodel":"wikitext","pagelanguage":"en","pagelanguagehtmlcode":"en","pagelanguagedir":"ltr","touched":"2026-11-17T19:37:02Z","lastrevid":1331372829,"length":3786}]}}